# ============================================================================
# NOTE: Be cautious with the following patterns
# ============================================================================

# If you need to version control specific files in ignored directories,
# use patterns like:
# !.gitkeep
# !/logs/.gitkeep
# !packages/NuGet.Config
# !/packages/repos.config

# To force add an ignored file:
# git add -f path/to/file

# To see what would be ignored:
# git status --ignored
# git check-ignore -v path/to/file